{"id":"n38379-1-8","stage":4,"title":"끔찍하다 · 厉害","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38379-1-8-1","ko":"올겨울은 유난히 춥네.","zh":"这个冬天格外冷啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올겨울은","meaning":"今年；冬天，冬季","explanation":"올：今年；겨울：冬天，冬季；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"},{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22072","senseId":"1","lemma":"올","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올겨울은","audio":"/audio/64fd6b97b4d701010c22.mp3"}},{"text":"유난히","meaning":"特别，异常，格外","explanation":"유난히：特别，异常，格外","readings":[{"term":"유난히","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72421","senseId":"1","lemma":"유난히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유난히","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3"}},{"text":"춥네.","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"춥네","audio":"/audio/3cdac75e87d4906fa12c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d4e5ba0f9d89e827","term":"올","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3","entryId":"22072","definition":"现在正在度过的年。","pronunciation":["올"]},{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"a981b34035c6d45e","term":"유난히","zh":"特别，异常，格外","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3","entryId":"72421","definition":"状态、性格、行为等与平常非常不同地。","pronunciation":["유ː난히"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e30b866b2d360adfed10.